{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Bazaar kill tokens below maximum level follow the level the player is shown",
  "contract": "At default settings a levelling character earns nothing from a creature grey to them, judged on the level they are shown. Two ungrouped level-20 characters each kill ten Kobold Vermin 6 (level 1-2) in Northshire; they are not grouped because a group follows its leader's scaling choice. The character with open-world scaling is shown them at about level 16, so they are not grey and pay 0-2 each: all ten paying zero has a chance of about 1 in 59,000. The character who switched scaling off sees level 1-2, grey at their level, and receives nothing.",
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
